  "findings": [
    {
      "id": "SCOPE48-C1",
      "priority": "P3",
      "path": "crates/fabelgeist-compute/src/kernel/mod.rs",
      "lines": [
        12,
        16
      ],
      "title": "Batch introduction makes a false universal submission claim",
      "evidence": "Reduce records all reduction passes into one encoder using ComputePass::record and submits once (reduce/mod.rs266-343). Every other primitive here calls dispatch is false. Hundreds of submits is a lost frame is an unmeasured universal performance claim.",
      "replacement": "A standalone ComputePass::dispatch finishes and submits its encoder. A solver can instead record many dependent dispatches into KernelBatch and submit them together."
    },
    {
      "id": "SCOPE48-C2",
      "priority": "P3",
      "path": "crates/fabelgeist-compute/src/kernel/mod.rs",
      "lines": [
        65,
        69
      ],
      "title": "Cached-path rationale overstates static uniform allocations",
      "evidence": "Static uniform_buffer::create returns None for zero uniform extent (GPU bind_group/uniform_buffer.rs18-20). The existing buffer-only DOUBLE fixture has no uniform. Every dispatch builds a uniform buffer and cannot afford it overstate code and evidence.",
      "replacement": "The cached path uses per-batch uniform slots for eligible interfaces and creates a fresh bind group per dispatch. See fast."
    }
  ],
  "ownership": "Both focused wording findings in received Kernel docs; root coordinates canonical peer fixes. Reviewer made no source edit.",
  "contracts_checked": [
    "ValidationScope waits once then always pops, retains actual PollError plus optional native cause; existing Native messages/direct sources preserved. No across-await guard or global-health/rollback claim.",
    "Fast dispatch drains observation before resolving earlier operation; OperationAndObservation preserves primary operation and exposes secondary. Counter increments only after both Ok, empty batch grids skip device/parameters/counter. Count does not establish finish/native acceptance.",
    "Fast preparation may consume arena slot before later error; encoder mutations cannot rollback. Arena publishes native chunk only after observation Ok. Fresh bind groups remain recording policy, not proven barrier cause.",
    "Fast constructor consumes immutable pipeline shader/entry/reflection. First resolver precedes checked shape. Folded shape/padded addresses and receiving actual Device axes remain distinct; empty first preserves multidimensional declarations without work.",
    "KernelCache successful constructor Result, source/device/policy key, racing build semantics checked. Browser/borrowed ResultOk not observed native success; no exactly-once claim. Static cache separately retains completed native rejection and excludes Progress; alreadyCompiled state not reset on retry failure.",
    "Submission finalization and queue scopes are separate and helper adds no completion wait. Host callbacks run after helperOk only; device-handled routes supply no synchronous validation verdict. Recorder/copy checks may be deferred until finish."
  ],
